#, no-wrap
msgid "Describe the steps business leaders can implement now to prepare to use quantum computing in workflows in the future.\n"
msgstr "Menghuraikan langkah-langkah yang boleh dilaksanakan oleh pemimpin perniagaan sekarang untuk bersedia menggunakan pengkomputeran kuantum dalam aliran kerja pada masa depan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explain the concepts of quantum readiness and quantum potential.\n"
msgstr "Menerangkan konsep kesediaan kuantum dan potensi kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explain the mission of quantum ecosystems.\n"
msgstr "Menerangkan misi ekosistem kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Locate the resources for staying current about quantum computing technology and the latest developments and breakthroughs.\n"
msgstr "Mencari sumber untuk terus dikemas kini tentang teknologi pengkomputeran kuantum dan perkembangan serta terobosan terkini.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Solving valuable problems with quantum technology {#solving-valuable-problems-with-quantum-technology}"
msgstr "Menyelesaikan masalah berharga dengan teknologi kuantum {#solving-valuable-problems-with-quantum-technology}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Many businesses would leap at the chance to go back in time to capitalize early on yesterday’s game-changing technologies, such as the internet. The chance to get ahead of the competition is here again with quantum computing. The technology is maturing, and now is the time to build your quantum skills and understand quantum’s immense potential for addressing computationally intensive problems.\n"
msgstr "Banyak perniagaan akan melompat untuk berpeluang kembali ke masa lalu untuk memanfaatkan awal teknologi pengubah permainan semalam, seperti internet. Peluang untuk mendahului persaingan hadir semula dengan pengkomputeran kuantum. Teknologi ini semakin matang, dan kini adalah masa untuk membina kemahiran kuantum anda dan memahami potensi kuantum yang sangat besar untuk menangani masalah intensif pengiraan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the era of quantum computing, system performance will be key in achieving full quantum potential and scale—when we can definitively demonstrate, in certain use cases, a significant performance advantage over classical computers. Specifically, when a quantum computation is either hundreds or thousands of times faster, needs a smaller fraction of the memory, or makes something seemingly impossible possible. Our work with UC Berkeley demonstrates the power of currently available IBM Quantum&reg; processors to explore meaningful computations and realistic applications before the era of fault tolerance.\n"
msgstr "Dalam era pengkomputeran kuantum, prestasi sistem akan menjadi kunci dalam mencapai potensi dan skala kuantum sepenuhnya — apabila kita secara pasti dapat menunjukkan, dalam kes penggunaan tertentu, kelebihan prestasi yang signifikan berbanding komputer klasikal. Khususnya, apabila pengiraan kuantum sama ada ratusan atau ribuan kali lebih cepat, memerlukan pecahan memori yang lebih kecil, atau menjadikan sesuatu yang kelihatan mustahil menjadi mungkin. Kerja kami dengan UC Berkeley menunjukkan kuasa pemproses IBM Quantum&reg; yang tersedia sekarang untuk meneroka pengiraan bermakna dan aplikasi realistik sebelum era toleransi ralat.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum computers could soon solve valuable problems that have long challenged classical supercomputers. Governments and industry leaders worldwide are already exploring potential use cases in healthcare, materials science, machine learning, and more. Organizations that dive in now and become quantum ready will have a distinct advantage as these technologies evolve.\n"
msgstr "Komputer kuantum mungkin akan segera menyelesaikan masalah berharga yang telah lama mencabar superkomputer klasikal. Kerajaan dan pemimpin industri di seluruh dunia sudah pun meneroka kes penggunaan berpotensi dalam penjagaan kesihatan, sains bahan, pembelajaran mesin, dan banyak lagi. Organisasi yang terjun sekarang dan menjadi quantum ready akan mempunyai kelebihan yang jelas apabila teknologi ini berkembang.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum readiness {#quantum-readiness}"
msgstr "Kesediaan kuantum {#quantum-readiness}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Quantum readiness** is a continuously evolving measure of organizational proficiency in quantum computing strategy, technology and operations. It characterizes the company’s progressive capabilities to leverage quantum technology to disrupt industries, create competitive advantage, and respond to threats from quantum-savvy competitors.\n"
msgstr "**Kesediaan kuantum** ialah ukuran kemahiran organisasi dalam strategi, teknologi, dan operasi pengkomputeran kuantum yang sentiasa berkembang. Ia mencirikan keupayaan progresif syarikat untuk memanfaatkan teknologi kuantum bagi mengganggu industri, mencipta kelebihan daya saing, dan bertindak balas terhadap ancaman daripada pesaing yang celik kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the triangles below to see the capabilities of quantum ready organizations.\n"
msgstr "**Kesediaan kuantum** adalah ukuran kemahiran organisasi dalam strategi, teknologi dan operasi pengkomputeran kuantum yang terus berkembang. Ia mencirikan keupayaan progresif syarikat untuk memanfaatkan teknologi kuantum bagi mengganggu industri, mewujudkan kelebihan daya saing, dan bertindak balas terhadap ancaman daripada pesaing yang mahir dalam kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Strategy**\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Strategi**\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: dropped, JSX/HTML tags differ from English: <Accordion>
# <AccordionItem title="Strategi">
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<ul>\n"
"<li>– Ability to convert quantum market information into actionable insights on opportunities and threats.</li>\n"
"<li>– Proficiency to capture business value from quantum-triggered strategies, capabilities, and innovation initiatives.</li>\n"
"<li>– Expertise to secure and protect Intellectual Property (IP) for quantum technologies.</li>\n"
"<li>– Influence of regulations and standards related to the intended use of quantum computing.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: dropped, JSX/HTML tags differ from English: <ul> <li>–
# Keupayaan untuk menukar maklumat pasaran kuantum
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  </AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"**Technology**\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"**Teknologi**\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<ul>\n"
"<li>– DevSecOps framework to build, test, deploy, and update quantum applications.</li>\n"
"<li>– AI and other advanced computational model maturity for supporting quantum addressable workflows.</li>\n"
"<li>– Hybrid cloud architecture that enables orchestration and interoperation of quantum-classical workloads.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
msgstr ""
"<ul>\n"
"<li>– Rangka kerja DevSecOps untuk membina, menguji, menggunakan, dan mengemas kini aplikasi kuantum.</li>\n"
"<li>– Kematangan model pengiraan canggih AI dan lain-lain untuk menyokong aliran kerja yang boleh ditangani oleh kuantum.</li>\n"
"<li>– Seni bina hybrid cloud yang membolehkan orkestra dan interoperasi beban kerja kuantum-klasikal.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"**Operations**\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"**Operasi**\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<ul>\n"
"<li>– Governance and oversight to ensure the successful execution of the quantum roadmap.</li>\n"
"<li>– Talent strategy and culture to build a high-performing team with quantum fluency.</li>\n"
"<li>– Innovation process that creates quantum-enabled solutions that meet business needs.</li>\n"
"<li>– Agile practices that result in high velocity of R & D and iterative solution design.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
msgstr ""
"<ul>\n"
"<li>– Tadbir urus dan pengawasan untuk memastikan pelaksanaan peta jalan kuantum yang berjaya.</li>\n"
"<li>– Strategi bakat dan budaya untuk membina pasukan berprestasi tinggi dengan kelancaran kuantum.</li>\n"
"<li>– Proses inovasi yang mencipta penyelesaian berkemampuan kuantum yang memenuhi keperluan perniagaan.</li>\n"
"<li>– Amalan Agile yang menghasilkan kecepatan tinggi dalam R & D dan reka bentuk penyelesaian berulang.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: dropped, JSX/HTML tags differ from English: </AccordionItem>
# </Accordion>
#. type: Plain text
