msgid "[Qiskit YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/qiskit): Engaging lectures, tips and tricks, tutorials, community updates, and access to exclusive Qiskit content. [Subscribe here](http://ibm.biz/q-subscribe) for weekly Qiskit videos\n"
msgstr "[Saluran YouTube Qiskit](https://www.youtube.com/qiskit): Kuliah menarik, petua dan helah, tutorial, kemas kini komuniti, dan akses ke kandungan Qiskit eksklusif. [Langgan di sini](http://ibm.biz/q-subscribe) untuk video Qiskit mingguan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Join our communities:\n"
"* [Qiskit Slack](http://qisk.it/join-slack): Submit a request to join the Qiskit slack workspace and connect with a community of quantum computing professionals and enthusiasts\n"
"* [Qiskit Stack Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/qiskit): A Q&A platform for engineers, scientist, programmers, and computing professionals interested in quantum computing using Qiskit\n"
"* [IBM Quantum Stack Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/ibm-q-experience): Q&A space on Stack Exchange about IBM Quantum Service - Circuit Composer\n"
"* [IBM Quantum Events](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/events): Stay updated and take part in upcoming quantum events\n"
"* [IBM Quantum Newsletter](http://ibm.biz/ibm-quantum-network-newsletter): Opt-in to stay tuned on quantum events, available only for the IBM Quantum Network.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sertai komuniti kami:\n"
"* [Qiskit Slack](http://qisk.it/join-slack): Hantar permintaan untuk menyertai ruang kerja Qiskit slack dan berhubung dengan komuniti profesional dan peminat pengkomputeran kuantum\n"
"* [Qiskit Stack Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/qiskit): Platform Soal Jawab untuk jurutera, saintis, pengaturcara, dan profesional pengkomputeran yang berminat dalam pengkomputeran kuantum menggunakan Qiskit\n"
"* [IBM Quantum Stack Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/ibm-q-experience): Ruang Soal Jawab di Stack Exchange tentang IBM Quantum Service - Circuit Composer\n"
"* [IBM Quantum Events](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/events): Kekal terkini dan ambil bahagian dalam acara kuantum yang akan datang\n"
"* [IBM Quantum Newsletter](http://ibm.biz/ibm-quantum-network-newsletter): Opt-in untuk kekal terkini tentang acara kuantum, hanya tersedia untuk IBM Quantum Network.\n"

